  "business-consulting": { title: "Business Consulting", blocks: [
  { t: "h2", x: "Business Consulting" },
  { t: "h2", x: "Are you a small business owner finding yourself at a place in your business where it feels like you’ve just hit the ceiling?" },
  { t: "p", x: "If you answered yes, then it may be time to consider hiring our team to help on a short-term basis.Together we will envision, inspire and transform your business.As the world of business moves faster and gets more competitive, it is difficult to keep up with both the changes in your industry as well as the innovations in sales, marketing, and management strategies.With years of successful experience, as your Business Consultants, we can provide valuable insight that will help you develop long-term and short-term goals and strategies, as well as improve your business in areas that you might have overlooked." },
  { t: "p", x: "As your business consultant, we will…" },
  { t: "li", x: "Help you better leverage your existing resources" },
  { t: "li", x: "Develop a personal plan for your business to achieve greater profitability and growth" },
  { t: "li", x: "Guide your team to great productivity and efficiency" },
  { t: "li", x: "Recommend results-driven strategies" },
  { t: "li", x: "Help to cultivate a fun and loyal work culture for your team" },
  { t: "li", x: "Help you discover the “hidden money” in your business" },
  { t: "li", x: "Establish an achievable plan for meeting your short and long term goals" },
  { t: "li", x: "Develop powerful online and offline strategies to implement into your business strategy" },
  { t: "li", x: "Making an investment with us shows us you are ready for solutions that create both profit and efficiency" },
  { t: "p", x: "We are excited to start a conversation with you and see if we are a good match for one another. Let’s set up a complimentary 45 min. strategy session and get to know each other!" }
] },
